  "ingredients": [
    "1 (29 ounce) can pears in juice, juice drained and reserved",
    "1 (3 ounce) package lemon-flavored gelatin mix (such as Jell-O®)",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "1 (12 ounce) container frozen whipped topping (Cool Whip®), thawed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kbSPg6_QyJuCK7QcrRvuLJotlGg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235747-pear-salad-DDMFS-Step-01-6c677a8fdb094b758ed394eb0b0c4f0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235747/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash pears with a fork in a bowl until desired consistency is reached.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yXJOvknDS1ejnICHIVgTNCyR4l4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235747-pear-salad-DDMFS-Step-02-3c7bf65f01b942f6be665e941383bf19.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235747/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure 1 1/2 cups juice from pears and pour into a saucepan; cook over medium-low heat until warmed, 5 to 10 minutes. Remove saucepan from heat and stir gelatin mix into pear juice until dissolved.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ggXAyww5g9fo-uhIQjCjktwU7ZI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235747-pear-salad-DDMFS-Step-03-898bb6e57bb94d748a44947b7b59a26c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235747/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cream cheese and milk into gelatin mixture until smooth. Fold whipped topping into mixture; add pears and mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1-6NtlyyzAA_ItFBxJldGVF9Wgc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235747-pear-salad-DDMFS-Step-04-a6778636acb04878b10b0fbd9c58a0f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235747/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon mixture into a 9x9-inch baking dish. Refrigerate until set, at least 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HfZDoLeEl1dtpzpeb7Xu-nAf_q0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235747-pear-salad-DDMFS-Step-05-9b29c197eee144558b9dede72dc41684.jpg"
